Thesaurus (^QL) and definition (^QU) lookups now open a dismissable overlay for the word under the cursor; choosing a synonym replaces the word in one undo step. Autocorrect fixes common typos as you type past a word separator, and smart typography turns straight quotes, `--`, and `...` into curly quotes, em dashes, and ellipses — each a single undoable edit and each independently toggleable in `config.toml` (R10).
